* GPSS Queue Analysis Tool
* Discrete-event simulation for multi-server queue performance
* Author: Autonomous AI Polyglot Software Engineer
* Language: GPSS

      GENERATE    10,3      * Arrivals every 10 units (+/- 3)
      SEIZE       Q1        * Seize a server
      QUEUE       Q1        * Wait in queue if server busy
      ADVANCE     20,5      * Service time 20 units (+/- 5)
      RELEASE     Q1        * Release server
      TERMINATE   1         * End transaction

      QUEUE       Q1        * Define queue
      SEIZE       Q1        * Define server resource

* Simulation control
      START       1000      * Run for 1000 transactions

* End of program
      STOP
